===Noun===
{{en-noun|barrels of monkeys}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic|informal}} Someone or something very [[amusing#Adjective|amusing]] or [[funny#Adjective|funny]], [[fun#Adjective|fun]], [[mischievous]], etc.
#: {{synonyms|en|hoot|riot}}
#: {{ux|en|He thinks he’s a '''barrel of monkeys''', but he’s not particularly entertaining.}}

====Usage notes====
Also used with other vessels, such as ''bag of monkeys'', ''cartload of monkeys'', and ''wagonload of monkeys''.

